<title>USA: Egghead Software CFO Wozniak quits.</title>
<headline>Egghead Software CFO Wozniak quits.</headline>
<dateline>SPOKANE, Wash 1996-10-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.S. software developer Egghead Software Inc said Thursday its chief financial officer had quit to accept a job at another company.</p>
<p>Egghead said in a statement that Edward Wozniak, who also served as vice president and secretary, resigned to become vice president and chief administrative officer at another company.</p>
<p>It did not identify the other company.</p>
<p>&quot;Egghead is in discussion with a highly qualified candidate to replace Wozniak and expects to make an announcement shortly,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
